{"verse_key": "10:44", "surah": 10, "verse": 44, "text_uthmani": "إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَظْلِمُ ٱلنَّاسَ شَيْـًٔا وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱلنَّاسَ أَنفُسَهُمْ يَظْلِمُونَ", "translation": "Indeed, Allāh does not wrong the people at all, but it is the people who are wronging themselves.", "verse_from_ms": 1067990, "verse_to_ms": 1081550, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 1067990, "end_ms": 1069450}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱللَّهَ", "start_ms": 1069450, "end_ms": 1070390}, {"i": 2, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 1070390, "end_ms": 1070640}, {"i": 3, "text": "يَظْلِمُ", "start_ms": 1070640, "end_ms": 1071590}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "start_ms": 1071590, "end_ms": 1072500}, {"i": 5, "text": "شَيْـًٔا", "start_ms": 1072500, "end_ms": 1073740}, {"i": 6, "text": "وَلَـٰكِنَّ", "start_ms": 1073740, "end_ms": 1075300}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "start_ms": 1075300, "end_ms": 1076550}, {"i": 8, "text": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "start_ms": 1076550, "end_ms": 1078130}, {"i": 9, "text": "يَظْلِمُونَ", "start_ms": 1078130, "end_ms": 1081105}]}